  m_text: "\r\nRFI\r\nInmate Number: \r\nUse this form to request clarification of
    policy, procedure, or status. RFIs do not request property or privileges.\r\n\r\n    
    Law library / legal access\r\n     Commissary eligibility\r\n     Property rules\r\n    
    Phone or visitation procedures\r\n     Housing\r\n\r\n(Requests framed as questions
    receive clarification only. Requests for items or privileges may be denied.)\n\n\nProvide
    me with: \n\r\n\r\nMore Information: \r\n"
